"The helper monitors displays and shuts down your Mac when the timeout expires. Installation requires administrator approval. Pause monitoring from the menu whenever needed." = "The helper monitors displays and shuts down your Mac when the timeout expires. Installation requires administrator approval. Pause monitoring from the menu whenever needed.";
"The countdown starts when all displays go offline and cancels when any display reconnects. A display must be detected after startup before monitoring is armed. Pausing, changing settings, or waking from sleep resets the countdown.\n\nWhen monitoring is enabled, the timeout triggers system shutdown. Pause monitoring to disable it. Quitting pauses monitoring; resume it manually when you reopen the app.\n\nUnplugging a display or disconnecting its power also counts as offline. The helper starts at boot; the menu bar app starts at login." = "The countdown starts when all displays go offline and cancels when any display reconnects. A display must be detected after startup before monitoring is armed. Pausing, changing settings, or waking from sleep resets the countdown.\n\nWhen monitoring is enabled, the timeout triggers system shutdown. Pause monitoring to disable it. Quitting pauses monitoring; resume it manually when you reopen the app.\n\nUnplugging a display or disconnecting its power also counts as offline. The helper starts at boot; the menu bar app starts at login.";
